# BudgetChek 2.0 prototype — environment configuration
#
# Safe to expose publicly: every value below is a Supabase PUBLISHABLE key
# (prefix "sb_publishable_") plus the project's public URL/ID. These are
# meant to ship inside the client bundle -- they are not secrets, and are
# the real values for this prototype's own Supabase project, kept here so
# anyone cloning the repo has a working local setup without asking around.
#
# NEVER put a secret here: no "sb_secret_..." key, no SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# no Stripe secret key, no database password. Server-only secrets belong in
# each deployment target's own secret store (e.g. Supabase Edge Function
# secrets, Cloudflare Worker secrets via `wrangler secret put`) -- never in
# a file that gets committed, .env.example included.
#
# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) to run locally: cp .env.example .env

SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="ifmphqppwcaueherhfwm"
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="sb_publishable_VTFwtr0qf_-wdaEPHmB5mQ_jCgC2kk7"
SUPABASE_URL="https://ifmphqppwcaueherhfwm.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="ifmphqppwcaueherhfwm"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="sb_publishable_VTFwtr0qf_-wdaEPHmB5mQ_jCgC2kk7"
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://ifmphqppwcaueherhfwm.supabase.co"
